✅✅ Lang Graph full course

🔹 ✅ Lang chain : It provides toolkit (LLM, RAG, prompts, Memory, Tools, Vector database) for building LLM applications.
   🔹 LangChain is build for linear step-by-step application.

🔹 ✅ Lang Graph : A workflow engine for building Intelligent AI using using LangChain components.
   🔹 LangGrapsh is built for complex, circular workflows that requires loops, reties, multi agents colloboration

🔹 ✅  WHy LangChain is prefered ??
   🔹 Modularity and Flexibility
   🔹 Faster developement and prototying
   🔹 Built-in tools for external integrations Ex: Databases
   🔹 Memory handling and context aware apps
   🔹 Decission making agents
   🔹 Simplifies complex workflow
   🔹 Active community and opensource


🔹 ✅  Components for LangGraph
🔹 1. State :  It is a shared memory traverse across the flow chart
🔹 2. Node : It is a task, can be executed using a plain python function.
🔹 3. Edge : Connection between nodes
🔹 4. Conditional edge : Based on conditions select the node
🔹 5. Stategraph : Like FLow chart

 ✅  How to tun LLM locally ?
